teeth, cream belly, thick tail. Plain white background, no text. Reads as
"alligator" at book size. Page l2-w02-check-row-alligator needs this picture.

ant (m2): one ant, dark red-brown, three round body parts, two antennae, small
smile, big eyes with highlights. Six legs show: four on the near side, two on the
