The prompt asked for three legs per side. The total is six, and six is what a
teacher counts. Under the bar this is not a defect. Page l2-w02-check-row-ant
uses m2 (m1 with four legs stays in the folder).

balls: five balls in a row, red, orange, yellow, green, blue. Same size, plain
color, no pattern. Plain white background, no text. Count is five. Page
