fourth face the side. Orange beaks, black eyes with highlights, folded wings,
short tails, orange feet. Plain white background, no text. Count is four. Page
l2-w02-story-page-how-many-birds-four needs four birds on the low branch.

cupcakes: left plate holds seven cupcakes, four at the back and three at the
front, pink cups with white cream swirls. Right plate is empty with soft cream
